# Scratch scripts and notes dropped at the repo root. Scoped to the root with
# a leading slash: an unanchored "test_*.py" also matches tests/test_*.py, which
# silently kept the real test suite out of every commit.
/test_*.py
/*.txt
!/requirements.txt

